{"title":"What should I ask Chris Arnade?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/912008153/0/marginalrevolution~What-should-I-ask-Chris-Arnade.html","date":1738310498000,"content":"<p><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Chris_Arnade\" target=\"_blank\">From Wikipedia</a>:</p>\r\n<blockquote><p><b>Chris Arnade…</b>is an American photographer and writer. He worked for 20 years as a <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bond_trader\">bond trader</a> on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Wall_Street\">Wall Street</a>; in 2011, he started documenting the lives of poor people and their <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Drug_addiction\">drug addictions</a> and commenting on the state of the <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Society_of_the_United_States\">society of the United States</a>. He did this through photographs posted on social media and articles in various media…<i></i></p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://walkingtheworld.substack.com/\" target=\"_blank\">Chris’s Substack</a>, here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/chris_arnade\" target=\"_blank\">Chris on Twitter</a>.  So what should I ask him?</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2025/01/what-should-i-ask-chris-arnade.html\">What should I ask Chris Arnade?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/912008153/0/marginalrevolution\